  (text "RECOVERY 5V CONVERTER — INTEGRATED DEVELOPMENT"
    (at 40.64 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "08b3b26f-612e-4e89-b556-4cffa39892fb")
  )
  (text "TPS552872RYQR: autonomous EN/UVLO, internal bias via floating EXTVCC; MODE low (PFM).\n4.5..35 V development envelope; 2 A steady target only. Source/thermal/dynamic qualification remains open."
    (at 40.64 50.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "177b9774-f203-41cd-80ec-e88c30d0c36b")
  )
  (text "SHARED INPUT FIXTURE: SYS_PWR_PERMITTED is supplied externally at this checkpoint.\nNo duplicate input/GND/+3V3 source flags; essential buck provides the existing fixtures.\nLocal input capacitors:98.1uF nominal here +4.5uF buck =102.6uF combined.\nShared source capacitance, current and simultaneous startup remain unqualified."
    (at 40.64 157.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a5435535-b460-4cca-b60b-ff5b27f67df2")
  )
  (text "50V BANK:8x10uF ceramic +5x68uF hybrid =420uF nominal, plus100nF.\n618.4uF endurance+tolerance sensitivity;650uF development allocation.\nCold/bias/ESR/aging bounds, combined startup and coupled loop remain open.\nHeavy loads require local staged slew/qualification; no receiving-board circuit is implied."
    (at 40.64 209.55 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "dec1f29a-136f-4eed-b0ce-51cffadc529f")
  )
  (text "U500 CUSTOM — REVIEW REQUIRED\nTPS552872RYQR:TI SLVSHG1 / RYQ0021A.\nGreen callout is approved alternative; symbol body color unsupported."
    (at 40.64 224.79 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 255 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ff88231b-a6c8-4795-8dbb-c811ba5779fe")
  )
  (text "OUTPUT BOUNDARY:5V0_RECOVERY_RAW bank stays BEFORE R503 shunt.\nR503.2/R504.1/U500.13 use5V0_RECOVERY_REG into attached rail barrier.\nProtected shared+5V exists only downstream of that barrier.\nFB remains upstream of disconnect; PG pullup uses essential+3V3."
    (at 40.64 184.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f1575ab1-43b4-4923-8b47-45e16823e54f")
  )
  (text "DEVELOPMENT: attached5V barrier does not qualify the complete supply or autonomous3V3 OV containment.\nSYS remains an external permitted fixture; physical RBF/charger/BMS absent. No PCB synchronization."
    (at 40.64 238.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1614ba70-44fb-4bf5-9000-3d5a26066bf0")
  )
  (text "2026-10-24: PRIOR EXTERNAL-SYS / ABSENT-CHARGER NOTES ARE OBSOLETE. SYS now comes through charger PowerPath."
    (at 40.64 251.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "809bb37d-7c21-4f1b-bbd0-0ba4613ffa05")
  )
